{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35634","headline":"刘员外寄移菊 · 李山甫","name":"刘员外寄移菊","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋来缘树复缘墙，怕共平芜一例荒。\n颜色不能随地变，风流唯解逐人香。\n烟含细叶交加碧，露拆寒英次第黄。\n深谢栽培与知赏，但慙终岁待重阳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李山甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35634.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35634","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}